"Select all that apply" questions with multiple correct options
Questions often reference a small concrete dataset or diagram (e.g., a scatter plot with labeled points, a small table of values)

Topics to draw from:

Decision trees: splitting criteria, overfitting vs tree depth, ID3 optimality, hybrid models like "perceptron trees" combining decision trees with perceptrons at leaf nodes
