Model selection and errors: diagnosing overfitting/underfitting from train vs test error patterns, effects of training data size, cross-validation mechanics and compute-budget tradeoffs, k-fold procedure correctness
Perceptron: convergence guarantees, mistake bounds, effect of feature scaling, inductive biases, manual weight-update tracing through examples, kernelized/modified update rules
Linear regression: closed-form solutions for simple cases, valid matrix/vector formulations of the MSE objective, effect of outliers and duplicated data on the fitted line, Gaussian noise assumption and MLE equivalence to squared error



